### Koleksi untuk ekstensi "REST Client" (VS Code)
@api = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@gw = http://localhost:4100

### 1. Login (salin token ke variabel @token di bawah)
POST {{api}}/auth/masuk
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budi@contoh.id", "password": "BudiRahasia#2026" }

###
@token = GANTI_DENGAN_TOKEN

### 2. Buat pesanan (stok berkurang)
POST {{api}}/pesanan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "item": [{ "produkId": 7, "jumlah": 1 }] }

### 3. Bayar pesanan -> dapat chargeId + paymentUrl (ganti :id)
POST {{api}}/pesanan/1/bayar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Lihat pesanan
GET {{api}}/pesanan/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Simulasi pembayaran sukses (ganti chargeId)
POST {{gw}}/v1/charges/ch_GANTI/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "paid" }

### 6. Simulasi duplikat (ID peristiwa sama dikirim dua kali)
POST {{gw}}/v1/charges/ch_GANTI/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "paid", "duplicateSameId": true }

### 7. Simulasi tanda tangan salah / replay
POST {{gw}}/v1/charges/ch_GANTI/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "paid", "tamper": "bad_signature" }

### 8. Simulasi kedaluwarsa (stok dikembalikan)
POST {{gw}}/v1/charges/ch_GANTI/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "expired" }

### 9. Log pengiriman webhook dari gateway
GET {{gw}}/v1/deliveries?charge_id=ch_GANTI

### 10. Buat gateway gagal pada permintaan berikutnya (503)
POST {{gw}}/_kontrol
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gagalBerikutnya": 503 }
